Third-party colormap data included in js/cmapdata.js

  Crameri, F., 2018, Scientific colour maps, doi:10.5281/zenodo.1243862.
  Released under the MIT license. (Oslo, Roma, RomaO, Lajolla, Batlow, Vik)

  Thyng, K. M., C. A. Greene, R. D. Hetland, H. M. Zimmerle, and
  S. F. DiMarco, 2016, True colors of oceanography: Oceanography, 29, 9-13.
  cmocean is released under the MIT license. (balance)

